    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill excludes from federal gross income all retired and retainer pay plus monthly disability, pay, annuity, or survivor benefits paid under titles 10, 14, 37, or 38 to members and former uniformed services. It affects DoD retirees, Coast Guard, PHS and NOAA commissioned corps.",
